or=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /1760673340\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e266]\n                  - link \"修改于8小时前· 来自Android\" [ref=e267] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /1760673340/378715458\n                - generic [ref=e269] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - heading \"专栏丨 即使赌，也要有价值投资的底线\" [level=3] [ref=e270]:\n                    - strong [ref=e271]: 专栏丨\n                    - text: 即使赌，也要有价值投资的底线\n                  - generic [ref=e273]:\n                    - text: 昨天重仓买入中国海洋石油是个错误，\n                    - text: 因为今天可能大跌，因为昨晚布油大跌，\n                    - text: 因为C7要放出石油储备，因为特说美胜了，战争结束了。\n                    - text: 怎么办？\n                    - text: 一是愿赌服输，割肉止损，认输出局。\n                    - text: 因为昨天买入时就知道自己是在投机是在赌，\n                    - text: 赌嘛，有赢有输，赢了别牛笔，输了要服输，挨打...\n                - generic [ref=e275]:\n                  - link \" 7\" [ref=e276] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e277]: \n                    - generic [ref=e278]: \"7\"\n                  - link \" 430\" [ref=e279] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e280]: \n                    - generic [ref=e281]: \"430\"\n                  - link \" 494\" [ref=e282] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e283]: \n                    - generic [ref=e284]: \"494\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e285] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e286]: \n                    - generic [ref=e287]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e288]:\n              - link [ref=e289] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /cozone\n                - img [ref=e290]\n              - generic [ref=e291]:\n                - generic [ref=e293]:\n                  - link \"柯中\" [ref=e294] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /cozone\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e295]\n                  - link \"修改于7小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e296] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /5243796549/378744005\n                - generic [ref=e299]:\n                  - generic [ref=e300]:\n                    - text: 实际上津巴布韦的禁止非法锂精矿出口，需要提交硫酸锂方案才允许出口的事情，对行业影响非常大。\n                    - text: 毕竟不少机构预期今年津巴布韦的碳酸锂当量有高达21w的量，而到了2027年有25w的量。\n                    - text: 今年平均每个月1.75万吨，明年是2.1万吨。\n                    - text: 而还有人说即使提交了硫酸锂方案，2027年1月开始也全面禁...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e301] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e302]:\n                  - link \" 5\" [ref=e303] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e304]: \n                    - generic [ref=e305]: \"5\"\n                  - link \" 201\" [ref=e306] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e307]: \n                    - generic [ref=e308]: \"201\"\n                  - link \" 271\" [ref=e309] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e310]: \n                    - generic [ref=e311]: \"271\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e312] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e313]: \n                    - generic [ref=e314]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e315]:\n              - link [ref=e316] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /yijiu86\n                - img [ref=e317]\n              - generic [ref=e318]:\n                - generic [ref=e320]:\n                  - link \"依旧发起\" [ref=e321] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /yijiu86\n                  - link \"5小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e322] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /8388576408/378766663\n                - generic [ref=e324] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - heading \"小白测试用小龙虾炒股\" [level=3] [ref=e325]\n                  - generic [ref=e327]:\n                    - text: 昨天安装配置了小龙虾，摸索了下怎么玩。\n                    - text: 今天搞定了第一个SKILL。\n                    - text: 告诉他要配置的Agent的类型，然后他就自己一顿鼓捣，很快就给搞定了。\n                    - text: 搞定了SKILL,发现我还没没有API KEY，又自动给帮忙搞了个免费的API，写了Python脚本。\n                    - text: 最后测试了一把，成功运行给出了分析报告并且给出了5...\n                  - img [ref=e329]\n                - generic [ref=e330]:\n                  - link \" 1\" [ref=e331] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e332]: \n                    - generic [ref=e333]: \"1\"\n                  - link \" 109\" [ref=e334] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e335]: \n                    - generic [ref=e336]: \"109\"\n                  - link \" 211\" [ref=e337] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e338]: \n                    - generic [ref=e339]: \"211\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e340] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e341]: \n                    - generic [ref=e342]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e343]:\n              - link [ref=e344] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /7448161277\n                - img [ref=e345]\n              - generic [ref=e346]:\n                - generic [ref=e348]:\n                  - link \"波西米亚弗雷迪\" [ref=e349] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /7448161277\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e350]\n                  - link \"修改于4小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e351] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /7448161277/378744304\n                - generic [ref=e353] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - heading \"专栏丨 招金矿业未来产量预测\" [level=3] [ref=e354]:\n                    - strong [ref=e355]: 专栏丨\n                    - text: 招金矿业未来产量预测\n                  - generic [ref=e357]:\n                    - text: 本文为我个人后续撰写《招金矿业与山东黄金 H 股深度综合估值测算》一文的第二篇铺垫文章。\n                    - text: 注）招金矿业的矿产金产量包含自产金和与买断金。由于买断金对利润贡献极低，其产量规模参考意义不大，因此本文所述产量均指自产金产量。关于买断金的定义和2024~2024年自产金产量计算依据等，请参照...\n                  - img [ref=e359]\n                - generic [ref=e360]:\n                  - link \" 17\" [ref=e361] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e362]: \n                    - generic [ref=e363]: \"17\"\n                  - link \" 73\" [ref=e364] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e365]: \n                    - generic [ref=e366]: \"73\"\n                  - link \" 285\" [ref=e367] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e368]: \n                    - generic [ref=e369]: \"285\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e370] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e371]: \n                    - generic [ref=e372]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e373]:\n              - link [ref=e374] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /2874741935\n                - img [ref=e375]\n              - generic [ref=e376]:\n                - generic [ref=e378]:\n                  - link \"门捷列夫学徒\" [ref=e379] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /2874741935\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e380]\n                  - link \"9小时前· 来自iPhone\" [ref=e381] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /2874741935/378714108\n                - generic [ref=e384]:\n                  - generic [ref=e385]:\n                    - text: 上个周末差不多是近期压力最大的一个周末，但昨天收盘居然是红的\n                    - img \"[困顿]\" [ref=e386]\n                    - text: ，今早川似乎又TACO了，虽然不能完全放松警惕但再次 证明不交易宏观地缘是一个很好的交易习惯：你我皆民科，一顿分析不如人家一个twitter或电话。\n                    - text: 终于可以好好聊聊产业。\n                    - text: 我非常看好openclaw但我认为当Gov都亲自下场...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e387] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e388]:\n           